{"Title":"An Act increasing veterans' property tax exemptions","BillNumber":"S1962","DocketNumber":"SD1855","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:09:47.27"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:09:47.27"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T10:51:54.81"},{"Id":"KWP1","Name":"Kelly W. Pease","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KWP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T10:51:54.81"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1962/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Velis, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1962) of John C. Velis, Steven George Xiarhos and Kelly W. Pease for legislation to increase veterans' property tax exemptions.  Revenue.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 5 of chapter 59 of the General Laws, as appearing is hereby amended in paragraph twenty-second by striking the figure \"400\" and replacing it with the following figure:- 800 \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 5 of chapter 59 of the General Laws, as appearing is hereby amended in paragraph twenty-second A by striking the figure \"750\" and replacing it with the following figure:- 1,500 \r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 5 of chapter 59 of the General Laws, as appearing is hereby amended in paragraph twenty-second B by striking the figure \"1,250\" and replacing it with the following figure:- 2,500 \r\n\tSECTION 5. Section 5 of chapter 59 of the General Laws, as appearing is hereby amended in paragraph twenty-second C by striking the figure \"1,500\" and replacing it with the following figure:- 3,000 \r\n\tSECTION 6. Section 5 of chapter 59 of the General Laws, as appearing is hereby amended in paragraph twenty-second E by striking the figure \"1000\" and replacing it with the following figure:- 2,000 \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J26","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J26"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}